  "notes": "Double-sided 22-way edge connector A|1 ... Z|22, labels on both sides (letters left, numbers right), recorded as separate contacts. Rows 1-17 carry the same label on both sides (polarity/leg not drawn; port keys L and L/2 = number contact and letter contact). Rows 18-22: V-Z all NC on the letter side; 18 NC, 19 -25V, 20 25V COM, 21 +25V, 22 CHASSIS on the number side. Shields C/3 (after sum inputs) and L/10 (after level-control inputs) not tied to a single port by the drawing. Revision 2 note in title block: 'REVISED TITLE BLOCK ADD M497C' (the 'C' is hand-added to the title). LEFT/RIGHT PRE OUT and EXT IN are not labelled as an insert, so no insert is recorded; they may serve as one. Legend: NC not connected."
